{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"; Music: spacey, with the classic C64 echo. Open the file with the TRACKER button to see it.\nTRACK LOAD \"Sound/Tracker/solar_system.amostrk\"\nTRACK PLAY\n\nRASTER 1,0,0,480,\"Black, Blue, White\"\nIMAGE LOAD 1,\"Graphics/Bobs/Solarsystem/00.png\"\nSPRITE 1,40,0,1\nSPRITE HANDLE 1,32,32\nSPRITE ZOOM 1,200,200\n\nSPRITE ON 1\n\nLOAD \"Graphics/berg.png\"\nI=0 : V=0 : X=0\nLoop:\n   SCROLL 0,I,0\n   ;SPRITE MOVE 1,2,0 \n   SPRITE ROTATE 1,V\n   \n   INC V : DEC X : DEC I\n   IF SPRITE#X(1) > 640 THEN \n      SPRITE MOVE 1,-640,0\n   ENDIF\n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO Loop"}